00:45:18.350 --> 00:45:22.220
We talk about data science
and clinical trials, but

00:45:22.820 --> 00:45:25.100
clinical trials are a big deal.

00:45:26.000 --> 00:45:28.530
They affect people's lives. And

00:45:29.270 --> 00:45:32.765
that definitely is a huge motivator
for me in my day to day.

00:45:34.190 --> 00:45:38.660
